DreamUIWidgetGeometryLibrary {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/DreamUIWidgetGeometryLibrary.h#DreamUIWidgetGeometryLibrary
    src   "Coordinate conversions between a widget's own space, the viewport and the screen -- this\nframework's USlateBlueprintLibrary.\n\nEverything returns bool and writes its answer through an out-parameter, where UMG's equivalents\nreturn the value directly. That is deliberate and it is about world-space UI: a panel welded to a\nmachine in the level has no viewport position until a camera is pointed at it, and the honest\nanswers are \"here it is\" and \"nowhere\", not a number computed in the wrong space. A caller that\nignores the bool gets a zero, not a lie that looks like a position."
    text  "控件自身空间、视口与屏幕之间的坐标转换——即本框架对应\nSlate 蓝图库的 USlateBlueprintLibrary。\n\n所有函数均返回 bool，并通过输出参数写出结果，而 UMG 中的对应函数\n直接返回值。这是有意为之，并且关乎世界空间 UI：焊接在关卡中某台机器上的面板，\n在摄像机对准它之前没有视口位置，诚实的答案只有“在这里”和“不在这里”，\n而不是在错误的空间中算出的数字。忽略 bool 的调用方\n得到的是零，而不是一个看起来像位置的谎言。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIWidgetGeometryLibrary:AbsoluteToLocal {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/DreamUIWidgetGeometryLibrary.h#DreamUIWidgetGeometryLibrary:AbsoluteToLocal
    src   "A viewport pixel position, in the widget's own space. Assumes the point lies in the widget's plane."
    text  "视口像素位置，位于控件自身空间中。假定该点位于控件所在平面内。"
    state machine
