DreamUIWidgetGeometryLibrary:GetLocalTopLeft {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/DreamUIWidgetGeometryLibrary.h#DreamUIWidgetGeometryLibrary:GetLocalTopLeft
    src   "The corner local coordinates are measured from, in the widget's own space.\n\nAlways zero, because LOCAL is defined with its origin at that corner -- the same thing UMG's\nGetLocalTopLeft answers for an ordinary widget. It exists so a graph written against UMG\nreads the same, and so the definition has somewhere to be stated."
    text  "局部坐标所测量的角点，位于控件自身空间中。\n\n始终为零，因为LOCAL就是以该角点为原点定义的——UMG的\nGetLocalTopLeft对普通控件返回的也是同一个值。它存在的目的是让按UMG编写的图表\n读起来一致，也让这一定义有处可述。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIWidgetGeometryLibrary:GetWidgetGeometry {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/DreamUIWidgetGeometryLibrary.h#DreamUIWidgetGeometryLibrary:GetWidgetGeometry
    src   "Read a widget's geometry -- UMG's GetCachedGeometry, GetTickSpaceGeometry and\nGetPaintSpaceGeometry all at once.\n\nOne function rather than three because there is nothing here for the three to disagree about:\nUMG's split exists because Slate paints from a cached element list that can lag a tick behind\nthe arrangement, and DreamGUI arranges and builds its draw calls in the same pass."
    text  "读取控件的几何信息——一次取得 UMG 的 GetCachedGeometry、GetTickSpaceGeometry 和\nGetPaintSpaceGeometry。\n\n用一个函数代替三个，是因为这里不存在三者会彼此不一致的情况：UMG 之所以拆分，\n是因为 Slate 从一个可能比排列慢一个 tick 的缓存元素列表绘制，\n而 DreamGUI 在同一遍中完成排列并构建绘制调用。"
    state machine
}

