DreamUIWidgetGeometryLibrary:TransformScalarLocalToAbsolute {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/DreamUIWidgetGeometryLibrary.h#DreamUIWidgetGeometryLibrary:TransformScalarLocalToAbsolute
    src   "A LENGTH converted between the two spaces, with no origin involved -- UMG's\nScalar_LocalToAbsolute and friends.\n\nDerived from the rect rather than from a transform: the ratio of the widget's pixel size to its\nlocal size is exactly the scale a length is subject to, and taking it from the rect means a\ncanvas scaler, a render scale and a parent's scale are all already in it. Uniform on both axes\nis assumed, as it is in UMG, and the wider axis decides when they differ."
    text  "在两个空间之间转换的长度，不涉及原点——即 UMG 的\nScalar_LocalToAbsolute 及其类似函数。\n\n由矩形而非变换推导：控件像素尺寸与其局部尺寸之比，正好是长度所受到的缩放比例，\n而从矩形取值意味着画布缩放器、渲染缩放以及父级缩放均已包含其中。\n假定两个轴上的缩放一致（与 UMG 中一样），\n不一致时由较宽的轴决定。"
    state machine
}

